1
00:00:00,866 --> 00:00:02,366
(Howard:)That's a kick.

2
00:00:02,367 --> 00:00:04,037
(Howard:)That's an actual kick.

3
00:00:09,341 --> 00:00:11,711
(Bernadette:)What are you doing?

4
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:13,840
(Howard:)I felt a kick.

5
00:00:13,845 --> 00:00:16,885
(Howard:)There's a baby in there.

6
00:00:16,882 --> 00:00:20,182
(Bernadette:)Oh, yeah, that's where I put it.

7
00:00:20,185 --> 00:00:23,275
(Howard:)Oh, I mean, I know
you're pregnant.

8
00:00:23,272 --> 00:00:24,522
(Howard:)I just...

9
00:00:24,523 --> 00:00:27,393
(Howard:)never connected
the idea of pregnancy

10
00:00:27,392 --> 00:00:30,982
(Howard:)and you actually having a baby.

11
00:00:30,979 --> 00:00:34,779
(Bernadette:)Which MIT did you go to?

12
00:00:38,203 --> 00:00:41,493
(Howard:)Oh, God, we are not ready
to have an infant in this house!

13
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:43,740
(Howard:)We don't have a crib,
we don't have diapers.

14
00:00:43,742 --> 00:00:45,242
(Howard:)We're not baby-proofed.

15
00:00:45,243 --> 00:00:49,083
(Howard:)Anyone can just walk in off the
street and lift our toilet lids!

16
00:00:49,081 --> 00:00:51,501
(Bernadette:)Howie, we have time
to do all that stuff.

17
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,920
(Howard:)Do we?

18
00:00:52,918 --> 00:00:54,088
(Howard:)Look at you.

19
00:00:54,086 --> 00:00:58,026
(Howard:)Willy Wonka would roll you
to the juicing room.

